            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi S
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                  %mn 4
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 0
                  %mo ,
                  %mn 4
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S[4](0,4)
            gives a cube but here there is an interesting feature.
          %p
            Five of the six faces of the cube
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
